{"title":"완전감각Dreamer","artist":"ONE OK ROCK","sourceId":"reference:A9MAVQQvRUJTtyViZlJ1","sourceHash":"4a663d7fb848ccc1544656410093ec679ffaf090985f32f7ffb2cb9d8d818c70","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":5103014,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":32.25,"end":34.86,"text":"So now my time is up","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":34.86,"end":36.18,"text":"Your game starts,","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":36.18,"end":37.52,"text":"My heart moving?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":37.52,"end":41.12,"text":"Past time has no meaning for us,","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":41.12,"end":42.73,"text":"It's not enough!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":42.73,"end":45.28,"text":"Will we make it better","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":45.28,"end":47.53,"text":"Or just stand here longer","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":47.53,"end":48.7,"text":"Say it,","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":48.7,"end":52.82,"text":"\"We can't end here till we can get it enough\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":52.82,"end":57.43,"text":"絶対的根拠はウソだらけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":57.43,"end":62.78,"text":"いつだってあるのは僕の","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":62.78,"end":67.67,"text":"自信や不安をかき混ぜた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":67.67,"end":72.95,"text":"弱いようで強い僕","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":72.95,"end":75.09,"text":"This is my own judgement!!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":75.09,"end":77.03,"text":"Got nothing to say!!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":77.03,"end":83.07,"text":"もしも他に何か思いつきゃ 速攻言うさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":83.07,"end":86.96000000000001,"text":"「完全感覚Dreamerが僕の名さ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":86.96000000000001,"end":88.55,"text":"Will say it?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":88.55,"end":90.33,"text":"Will say it!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":90.33,"end":92.75,"text":"あればあるで聞くが今は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":92.75,"end":95.37,"text":"Hold on!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":113.14,"end":115.9,"text":"Yeah when I'm caught in fire","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":115.9,"end":118.46000000000001,"text":"When I rise up higher","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":118.46000000000001,"end":121.07,"text":"Do you see me out there","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":121.07,"end":123.51,"text":"Waiting for the next chance we get","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":123.51,"end":125.18,"text":"Will we make it,","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":125.18,"end":126.15,"text":"IT'S NOT ENOUGH!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":126.15,"end":128.32,"text":"Or just stand here longer","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":128.32,"end":129.43,"text":"Say it,","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":129.43,"end":133.61,"text":"\"We can't end here till we can get it enough\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":133.61,"end":138.28,"text":"確信犯? 知能犯? NO NO NO!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":138.28,"end":143.69,"text":"いつだってその場しのぎの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":143.69,"end":148.59,"text":"持論や理論を織り交ぜた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":148.59,"end":153.79,"text":"自由さユニークさもなく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":153.79,"end":155.92000000000002,"text":"This is my own judgement!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":155.92000000000002,"end":157.73,"text":"Got nothing to say!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":157.73,"end":163.98,"text":"もしも他に何か思いつきゃ 速攻言うさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":163.98,"end":168.05,"text":"「完全感覚Dreamerが僕の名さ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":168.05,"end":169.24,"text":"Will say it?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":169.24,"end":171.1,"text":"Will say it!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":171.1,"end":176.06,"text":"You know I've got to be NUMBER ONE!!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":196.69,"end":199.22,"text":"どうだい？予想外?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":199.22,"end":201.57999999999998,"text":"面食らって、はばかれて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":201.57999999999998,"end":208.15,"text":"後退? して撤退? って Yeah!!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":208.15,"end":212.22,"text":"完全感覚Dreamer的 空想","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":212.22,"end":218.11,"text":"誰が何を言おうが言わまいが無関係","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":218.11,"end":222.42000000000002,"text":"どうやったっていつも変わらない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":222.42000000000002,"end":228.39,"text":"壁を闇をこれからもぶっ壊していくさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":228.39,"end":233.37,"text":"完全感覚Dreamer","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":233.37,"end":238.15,"text":"完全感覚Dreamer","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":238.15,"end":240.94,"text":"Yeah when I'm caught in fire","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":240.94,"end":243.51,"text":"When I rise up higher","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":243.51,"end":245.95,"text":"Do you see me out there","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":245.95,"end":247.0,"text":"I can't get enough!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":247.0,"end":248.07,"text":"Can't get enough!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":